data: {"id": "a145fa1e5f25422b-thinking-parallel_evidence-1053", "run_id": "a145fa1e5f25422b", "node": "parallel_evidence", "node_name": "parallel_evidence", "thinking_type": "ai_message", "tool_name": null, "content": "## 已采集事实\n\n### 1. Pod 生命周期与状态 (Metrics + kubectl_describe)\n- **Phase**: `Pending`（Prometheus: `kube_pod_status_phase{phase=\"Pending\"}=1`；其他 Phase 均为 0）\n- **UID**: `7b4662a1-9238-48bd-89b5-e43d3a4c700d`\n- **Node**: `<none>` — 未被调度到任何节点\n- **重启**: 无（未返回 restarts 数据，符合 Pending 预期）\n- **等待原因**: Prometheus 未返回 `waiting_reason`，因为 Pod 甚至还未进入 `ContainerCreating` 阶段\n\n### 2. 调度失败事件 (kubectl_describe Events)\n- **Warning FailedScheduling** 在 91s 前由 `default-scheduler` 发出：\n  > `0/3 nodes are available: 3 Insuf", "status": null, "result_preview": null, "duration_seconds": null, "iteration": 2, "ts_ms": 1788860589340, "lane_stage": "evidence"}

